# The title's Help (the cards and the controls list with the bound keys),
# Settings (a game setting toggled, the inline reset confirmation, Cancel),
# the guest's Leaderboards note, and the daily briefing (ranked).
until 300 Play
frames 5
click Help
until 60 Controls
expect SPACE / ENTER / NUM ENTER / tap
frames 5
save help
key Escape 2
until 60 Play
frames 5
click Settings
until 60 Captions / text cues
frames 5
click Timing assist reticle
frames 5
save settings
click Reset all progress
until 30 Erase everything
frames 5
save confirm
click Cancel
until 30 Reset all progress
key Escape 2
until 60 Play
frames 5
click Leaderboards
until 60 Sign in with StarHermit to see the leaderboards.
frames 5
save leaderboard
key Escape 2
until 60 Play
frames 5
click Daily Challenge
until 60 Ranked (daily board)
frames 5
save daily
